# Cyclopean Tomb's "at the beginning of each of your upkeeps for the rest of the game, remove all mire counters from a
# land that a mire counter was put onto with this artifact ..." is a delayed ability of the card whose ability resolves
# (CR 603.7), the card a copy copies (CR 707.2). Bot1's Copy Artifact enters as a copy of Bot2's Tomb on turn 3, mires
# Bot2's Island in Bot1's turn 5 upkeep and is Disenchanted that turn; in Bot1's turn 7 upkeep the counter comes off.

